{"4302490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "My Idle Witch", "steam_appid": 4302490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>A little witch companion on your desktop</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    A cute little witch who brews potions on your screen while you work or unwind. Improve her stats over time and watch her become a more efficient little alchemist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302490/extras/00dfc75657b6c207bb61255a0d36f3cc.poster.avif?t=1774522897\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302490/extras/00dfc75657b6c207bb61255a0d36f3cc.webm?t=1774522897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302490/extras/00dfc75657b6c207bb61255a0d36f3cc.mp4?t=1774522897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Brew, sell, and progress at your own pace</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which potion to brew and let her work in the background. Follow daily market trends to earn more coins, complete simple quests, or just enjoy watching the brewing process unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302490/extras/3ee38698e7ff8607c6e9f3613db243c0.poster.avif?t=1774522897\" width=1170 height=484 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302490/extras/3ee38698e7ff8607c6e9f3613db243c0.webm?t=1774522897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302490/extras/3ee38698e7ff8607c6e9f3613db243c0.mp4?t=1774522897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Customise your witch and her workshop</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Collect dresses, and more than 60 furniture to personalise both your witch and her cozy little workspace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302490/extras/5b0a8345c0017604b73703456760d6a9.poster.avif?t=1774522897\" width=1170 height=484 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302490/extras/5b0a8345c0017604b73703456760d6a9.webm?t=1774522897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302490/extras/5b0a8345c0017604b73703456760d6a9.mp4?t=1774522897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Use productivity tools for your work sessions</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Stay focused on your own work with simple tools like checklists, timers, and Pomodoro sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302490/extras/1aa85f04f6535f7eec8b63a3b573df5a.poster.avif?t=1774522897\" width=1170 height=484 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302490/extras/1aa85f04f6535f7eec8b63a3b573df5a.webm?t=1774522897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302490/extras/1aa85f04f6535f7eec8b63a3b573df5a.mp4?t=1774522897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>A little witch companion on your desktop</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    A cute little witch who brews potions on your screen while you work or unwind. Improve her stats over time and watch her become a more efficient little alchemist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302490/extras/00dfc75657b6c207bb61255a0d36f3cc.poster.avif?t=1774522897\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302490/extras/00dfc75657b6c207bb61255a0d36f3cc.webm?t=1774522897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302490/extras/00dfc75657b6c207bb61255a0d36f3cc.mp4?t=1774522897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Brew, sell, and progress at your own pace</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which potion to brew and let her work in the background. Follow daily market trends to earn more coins, complete simple quests, or just enjoy watching the brewing process unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302490/extras/3ee38698e7ff8607c6e9f3613db243c0.poster.avif?t=1774522897\" width=1170 height=484 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302490/extras/3ee38698e7ff8607c6e9f3613db243c0.webm?t=1774522897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://s